      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LINDERMANN (1) comes down from Sydney and is going as well as ever. Found the hot pace of the G1 Winx Stakes too much first up but controlled things nicely to take the G2 Chelmsford second up. Gets a dry track, 1800m is perfect and Shinn should go straight to the front where he'll be very hard to catch. Loved the return of BIRDMAN (6) in the G1 Memsie Stakes here when picking up strongly late. He was a very good winner of the G2 Blamey second up last campaign then bolted in with the G2 Peter Young here. Can settle closer and rip home. COSMIC CRUSADER (5) was ridden negatively in the G1 Memsie as favourite last time and ran on well for third. He's a G1 winner over this trip and should land in a much better spot now. BUCKAROO (2) was also very good from the back in the G1 Memsie. He won this dominantly two years ago then just missed Sir Delius last year, look for him late.",
